# Personal, usually copyrighted material: keep it local
academic-paper-skill/resources/guides/*
!academic-paper-skill/resources/guides/README.md
academic-paper-skill/resources/field-papers/*
!academic-paper-skill/resources/field-papers/README.md
# Journal profiles: the converted guide and sample papers stay local;
# the requirements, section models and phrase lists may be shared
academic-paper-skill/resources/journals/*/guide.md
academic-paper-skill/resources/journals/*/papers/
academic-paper-skill/resources/journals/*/requirements_draft.md

# Script outputs in the working folder
/citation_report.md
/section_phrases.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
